{"seq":2,"slug":"blue-green-ring-deployments","title":"蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/blue-green-ring-deployments","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"蓝绿部署与环形发布-多环策略与流量路由\">蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由</h1><h2 id=\"引言-环境切换式发布\">引言：环境切换式发布</h2><p>蓝绿部署（Blue-Green Deployment）是最经典的零停机发布策略之一。其核心思想简洁直观：<strong>维护两套完整的生产环境，通过流量入口切换实现版本发布与瞬时回滚</strong>。与 <a href=\"canary-releases\">金丝雀发布</a> 的&quot;渐进式比例扩大&quot;不同，蓝绿部署的切换是&quot;全有或全无&quot;的——流量要么 100% 在蓝环境，要么 100% 在绿环境。</p>\n<p>环形发布（Ring-Based Deployment）则是蓝绿思想的多阶段扩展，由 Microsoft 在 Azure DevOps 实践中推广。它定义了多个&quot;环&quot;——从最小风险的内部环到最大范围的全量环——每一环都是一道独立的验证关卡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>蓝绿部署与环形发布共享同一个内核：<strong>用环境隔离换取瞬时回滚能力</strong>。新版本先部署到一套与生产隔离的环境中完成验证，通过后再由流量入口切换过去；出问题时只需把流量切回旧环境，无需重新部署。</p>\n<p>两者的差异在&quot;切换粒度&quot;上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>蓝绿部署</strong>：两套完整环境，切换是&quot;全有或全无&quot;的，回滚以秒计，代价是双倍基础设施；</li>\n<li><strong>环形发布</strong>：不是两个环境而是多个环，从内部团队到早期采纳者再到全量用户，每环之间设质量门；</li>\n<li><strong>共同前提</strong>：新旧版本必须能同时访问同一数据库，因此需要 Expand-Contract 这类向后兼容的 schema 演进策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"蓝绿部署原理\">蓝绿部署原理</h2><h3 id=\"基本架构\">基本架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    LB[Load Balancer - 流量路由控制点] --&gt; Blue[Blue 环境 - 当前生产 v1.2.0 - 100% 流量]&#10;    LB --&gt; Green[Green 环境 - 新版本 v1.3.0 - 0% 流量]&#10;    Green --&gt; Validate{验证通过?}&#10;    Validate -- 是 --&gt; Switch[切换流量路由: Blue 0% / Green 100%]\">flowchart TD\n    LB[Load Balancer - 流量路由控制点] --&gt; Blue[Blue 环境 - 当前生产 v1.2.0 - 100% 流量]\n    LB --&gt; Green[Green 环境 - 新版本 v1.3.0 - 0% 流量]\n    Green --&gt; Validate{验证通过?}\n    Validate -- 是 --&gt; Switch[切换流量路由: Blue 0% / Green 100%]</pre><h3 id=\"发布流程\">发布流程</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>准备绿环境</strong>：将新版本部署到绿环境（当前空闲）</li>\n<li><strong>内部验证</strong>：在绿环境运行冒烟测试、集成测试</li>\n<li><strong>流量切换</strong>：将负载均衡器/DNS 指向绿环境</li>\n<li><strong>观测期</strong>：监控新版本在全量流量下的表现</li>\n<li><strong>确认或回滚</strong>：<ul>\n<li>正常 → 绿环境成为新的&quot;蓝&quot;（生产），旧蓝环境待命</li>\n<li>异常 → 立即切回蓝环境（瞬时回滚）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>清理</strong>：稳定后释放旧环境资源或保留作为下次发布的目标</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"kubernetes-实现\">Kubernetes 实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 方式一：Service selector 切换&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-app&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: my-app&#10;    version: green # 切换时改为 &quot;blue&quot; 或 &quot;green&quot;&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 8080&#10;---&#10;# Blue Deployment&#10;apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-app-blue&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: my-app&#10;      version: blue&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: my-app&#10;        version: blue&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: my-app&#10;          image: my-app:1.2.0&#10;---&#10;# Green Deployment&#10;apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-app-green&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: my-app&#10;      version: green&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: my-app&#10;        version: green&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: my-app&#10;          image: my-app:1.3.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式一：Service selector 切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 切换时改为 \"blue\" 或 \"green\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Blue Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app-blue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">blue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">blue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app:1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Green Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app-green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app:1.3.0</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"蓝绿部署的优势与局限\">蓝绿部署的优势与局限</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时回滚（秒级）</td>\n<td>需要双倍基础设施资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整的预发布验证环境</td>\n<td>数据库 schema 兼容性挑战</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换操作简单明确</td>\n<td>长连接/WebSocket 可能中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 CI/CD 集成成熟</td>\n<td>无法做比例灰度（全有或全无）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本隔离干净</td>\n<td>环境差异可能掩盖问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"环形发布-ring-based-deployment\">环形发布（Ring-Based Deployment）</h2><h3 id=\"microsoft-的阶段模型\">Microsoft 的阶段模型</h3><p>Microsoft 使用&quot;层（Ring）+ 阶段（Stage）&quot;的组合模型来管理功能发布。这是蓝绿思想在大规模组织中的自然演进——不是两个环境，而是<strong>多个环</strong>，每个环代表不同规模和风险级别的用户群：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R0[&quot;Ring 0: 开发团队自身 (~10人)&quot;] --&gt; V0[验证基本功能]&#10;    V0 --&gt; R1[&quot;Ring 1: 内部 Dogfood (~1,000人)&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; V1[内部用户密集使用]&#10;    V1 --&gt; R2[&quot;Ring 2: 早期采纳者/Insider (~10,000人)&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; V2[外部用户的 opt-in 测试]&#10;    V2 --&gt; R3[&quot;Ring 3: 大规模验证 (~100,000人)&quot;]&#10;    R3 --&gt; V3[统计显著性验证]&#10;    V3 --&gt; R4[&quot;Ring 4: 全量发布 (所有用户)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    R0[\"Ring 0: 开发团队自身 (~10人)\"] --&gt; V0[验证基本功能]\n    V0 --&gt; R1[\"Ring 1: 内部 Dogfood (~1,000人)\"]\n    R1 --&gt; V1[内部用户密集使用]\n    V1 --&gt; R2[\"Ring 2: 早期采纳者/Insider (~10,000人)\"]\n    R2 --&gt; V2[外部用户的 opt-in 测试]\n    V2 --&gt; R3[\"Ring 3: 大规模验证 (~100,000人)\"]\n    R3 --&gt; V3[统计显著性验证]\n    V3 --&gt; R4[\"Ring 4: 全量发布 (所有用户)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"环形发布与特性开关的结合\">环形发布与特性开关的结合</h3><p>在实际实现中，环形发布通常通过特性开关的 <a href=\"../foundations/targeting-segmentation\">目标定向规则</a> 来控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;flag&quot;: &quot;new-editor-experience&quot;,&#10;  &quot;environments&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Ring 0 - Dev Team&quot;,&#10;          &quot;conditions&quot;: [{ &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;email&quot;, &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;ends_with&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;@team.com&quot; }],&#10;          &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Ring 1 - Internal Dogfood&quot;,&#10;          &quot;conditions&quot;: [{ &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;orgId&quot;, &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;eq&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;internal-org&quot; }],&#10;          &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Ring 2 - Insider&quot;,&#10;          &quot;conditions&quot;: [{ &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;insiderOptIn&quot;, &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;eq&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: true }],&#10;          &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Ring 3 - Broad Validation&quot;,&#10;          &quot;percentage&quot;: 25,&#10;          &quot;variation&quot;: &quot;enabled&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;defaultVariation&quot;: &quot;disabled&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"flag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new-editor-experience\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"environments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ring 0 - Dev Team\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ends_with\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@team.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ring 1 - Internal Dogfood\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orgId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal-org\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ring 2 - Insider\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insiderOptIn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ring 3 - Broad Validation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"percentage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"variation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"defaultVariation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"disabled\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"环间推进的决策门\">环间推进的决策门</h3><p>每个环到下一个环之间需要通过<strong>质量门（Quality Gate）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环间跃迁</th>\n<th>决策依据</th>\n<th>典型等待时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0 → 1</td>\n<td>冒烟测试通过 + 团队主观体验</td>\n<td>1-2 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 → 2</td>\n<td>内部反馈 + 系统指标稳定</td>\n<td>3-7 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 → 3</td>\n<td>Insider 反馈 + 无严重 Bug</td>\n<td>1-2 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 → 4</td>\n<td>统计显著性 + 业务指标健康</td>\n<td>1-4 周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"蓝绿-金丝雀的混合策略\">蓝绿 + 金丝雀的混合策略</h2><p>在实践中，纯蓝绿部署的&quot;全切&quot;风险较高，而纯金丝雀的渐进过程较慢。许多团队采用混合策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"阶段 1: 蓝绿切换，但先只切 5% 流量到绿环境（金丝雀验证）&#10;阶段 2: 确认健康后，扩大到 50%&#10;阶段 3: 全量切换到绿环境&#10;保留蓝环境 24-72 小时用于快速回滚\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 1: 蓝绿切换，但先只切 5% 流量到绿环境（金丝雀验证）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 2: 确认健康后，扩大到 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 3: 全量切换到绿环境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>保留蓝环境 24-72 小时用于快速回滚</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种混合方式结合了两者优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>蓝绿的<strong>环境隔离</strong>（两个版本运行在完全独立的实例上）</li>\n<li>金丝雀的<strong>渐进验证</strong>（不是一次性切换全部流量）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"argo-rollouts-的蓝绿策略\">Argo Rollouts 的蓝绿策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Rollout&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service&#10;spec:&#10;  strategy:&#10;    blueGreen:&#10;      activeService: my-service-active&#10;      previewService: my-service-preview&#10;      autoPromotionEnabled: false&#10;      prePromotionAnalysis:&#10;        templates:&#10;          - templateName: smoke-tests&#10;      postPromotionAnalysis:&#10;        templates:&#10;          - templateName: post-deploy-checks&#10;      scaleDownDelaySeconds: 86400 # 回滚窗口：24小时\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Rollout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    blueGreen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      activeService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service-active</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      previewService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service-preview</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      autoPromotionEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      prePromotionAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        templates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">templateName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">smoke-tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      postPromotionAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        templates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">templateName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">post-deploy-checks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      scaleDownDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 回滚窗口：24小时</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据库兼容性策略\">数据库兼容性策略</h2><p>蓝绿部署和环形发布的最大挑战之一是<strong>数据库 schema 兼容性</strong>——两个版本的代码可能需要同时访问同一个数据库。</p>\n<h3 id=\"expand-contract-迁移模式\">Expand-Contract 迁移模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Phase1[&quot;Phase 1: Expand 扩展&quot;]&#10;        A1[添加新列/新表, 不删除旧结构]&#10;        A2[新代码同时写入新旧字段]&#10;        A3[旧代码继续使用旧字段]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Phase2[&quot;Phase 2: 验证 - 蓝绿切换期&quot;]&#10;        B1[新版本绿读写新字段]&#10;        B2[旧版本蓝/备用读写旧字段]&#10;        B3[两个版本共存无冲突]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Phase3[&quot;Phase 3: Contract 收缩&quot;]&#10;        C1[确认旧版本不再需要]&#10;        C2[迁移旧数据到新结构]&#10;        C3[删除旧列/旧表]&#10;    end&#10;    Phase1 --&gt; Phase2 --&gt; Phase3\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Phase1[\"Phase 1: Expand 扩展\"]\n        A1[添加新列/新表, 不删除旧结构]\n        A2[新代码同时写入新旧字段]\n        A3[旧代码继续使用旧字段]\n    end\n    subgraph Phase2[\"Phase 2: 验证 - 蓝绿切换期\"]\n        B1[新版本绿读写新字段]\n        B2[旧版本蓝/备用读写旧字段]\n        B3[两个版本共存无冲突]\n    end\n    subgraph Phase3[\"Phase 3: Contract 收缩\"]\n        C1[确认旧版本不再需要]\n        C2[迁移旧数据到新结构]\n        C3[删除旧列/旧表]\n    end\n    Phase1 --&gt; Phase2 --&gt; Phase3</pre><h3 id=\"无中断-schema-变更规则\">无中断 Schema 变更规则</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>只做加法，不做减法</strong>：在蓝绿共存期间，只添加列/索引，不删除或重命名</li>\n<li><strong>新列允许 NULL 或有默认值</strong>：旧版本不写入新列不应导致错误</li>\n<li><strong>应用层向后兼容</strong>：新代码能处理旧数据格式，旧代码能忽略新字段</li>\n<li><strong>独立的数据迁移步骤</strong>：schema 变更与应用部署是独立的发布事件</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"流量路由技术\">流量路由技术</h2><h3 id=\"dns-切换\">DNS 切换</h3><p>最简单的蓝绿切换方式——修改 DNS 记录指向不同的 IP/负载均衡器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：实现简单，与基础设施无关</li>\n<li><strong>劣势</strong>：DNS TTL 导致切换延迟（即使设为 30s，也有缓存影响）</li>\n<li><strong>适用</strong>：低频发布、对切换速度要求不高的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"负载均衡器权重\">负载均衡器权重</h3><p>通过调整负载均衡器的后端权重实现切换：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：切换即时（无 DNS 缓存问题）</li>\n<li><strong>劣势</strong>：依赖具体的 LB 实现</li>\n<li><strong>适用</strong>：需要快速切换的高频发布场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"服务网格路由\">服务网格路由</h3><p>通过 Istio/Linkerd 等服务网格的 L7 路由规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：支持复杂的路由条件（Header 匹配、百分比分流）</li>\n<li><strong>劣势</strong>：引入服务网格的运维复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>适用</strong>：已使用服务网格的微服务架构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与-ci-cd-流水线的集成\">与 CI/CD 流水线的集成</h2><p>蓝绿部署深度嵌入 <a href=\"../../ci-cd-pipelines/\">CI/CD 流水线</a>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 蓝绿部署流水线示例&#10;name: Blue-Green Deploy&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  deploy:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: Build &amp; Push Image&#10;        run: docker build -t my-app:${{ github.sha }} .&#10;&#10;      - name: Deploy to Green&#10;        run: kubectl set image deployment/my-app-green my-app=my-app:${{ github.sha }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Wait for Green Ready&#10;        run: kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app-green --timeout=300s&#10;&#10;      - name: Run Smoke Tests on Green&#10;        run: ./run-smoke-tests.sh --target=green&#10;&#10;      - name: Switch Traffic to Green&#10;        run: |&#10;          kubectl patch service my-app -p &#39;{&quot;spec&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;version&quot;:&quot;green&quot;}}}&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Post-switch Monitoring&#10;        run: ./monitor-health.sh --duration=10m --threshold=0.99&#10;&#10;      - name: Confirm or Rollback&#10;        run: |&#10;          if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then&#10;            kubectl patch service my-app -p &#39;{&quot;spec&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;version&quot;:&quot;blue&quot;}}}&#39;&#10;            exit 1&#10;          fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 蓝绿部署流水线示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Blue-Green Deploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  deploy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build &#x26; Push Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker build -t my-app:${{ github.sha }} .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deploy to Green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kubectl set image deployment/my-app-green my-app=my-app:${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Wait for Green Ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app-green --timeout=300s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Smoke Tests on Green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./run-smoke-tests.sh --target=green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Switch Traffic to Green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          kubectl patch service my-app -p '{\"spec\":{\"selector\":{\"version\":\"green\"}}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Post-switch Monitoring</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./monitor-health.sh --duration=10m --threshold=0.99</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Confirm or Rollback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            kubectl patch service my-app -p '{\"spec\":{\"selector\":{\"version\":\"blue\"}}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          fi</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"蓝绿-vs-金丝雀-选型决策\">蓝绿 vs 金丝雀：选型决策</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策因素</th>\n<th>蓝绿部署</th>\n<th>金丝雀发布</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回滚速度</td>\n<td>极快（流量切换）</td>\n<td>快（流量权重归零）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源开销</td>\n<td>高（双倍基础设施）</td>\n<td>低-中（额外少量实例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险控制粒度</td>\n<td>粗（全有或全无）</td>\n<td>细（1%→5%→25%→100%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证深度</td>\n<td>预发布验证 + 全量观测</td>\n<td>生产流量逐步验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>SLA 极高、快速回滚优先</td>\n<td>需要渐进验证、流量精细控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选型建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>银行/金融/电信</strong>：优先蓝绿（瞬时回滚能力 &gt; 渐进验证）</li>\n<li><strong>互联网 C 端产品</strong>：优先金丝雀（渐进验证 &gt; 资源效率）</li>\n<li><strong>大规模微服务</strong>：混合模式（基础设施蓝绿 + 应用层金丝雀）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>蓝绿部署与环形发布的核心价值：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>零停机</strong>：流量切换不影响在线用户</li>\n<li><strong>瞬时回滚</strong>：切回旧环境只需改变路由规则</li>\n<li><strong>环境隔离</strong>：新旧版本运行在完全独立的基础设施上</li>\n<li><strong>多环验证</strong>：从内部到外部逐步扩大暴露范围</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与 <a href=\"canary-releases\">金丝雀发布</a> 和 <a href=\"percentage-rollout-strategies\">百分比灰度策略</a> 形成互补：蓝绿提供环境级隔离和快速回滚，金丝雀/百分比灰度提供流量级精细控制。三者的组合构成了完整的渐进交付工具箱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由","id":"蓝绿部署与环形发布-多环策略与流量路由"},{"level":2,"text":"引言：环境切换式发布","id":"引言-环境切换式发布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"蓝绿部署原理","id":"蓝绿部署原理"},{"level":3,"text":"基本架构","id":"基本架构"},{"level":3,"text":"发布流程","id":"发布流程"},{"level":3,"text":"Kubernetes 实现","id":"kubernetes-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"蓝绿部署的优势与局限","id":"蓝绿部署的优势与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"环形发布（Ring-Based Deployment）","id":"环形发布-ring-based-deployment"},{"level":3,"text":"Microsoft 的阶段模型","id":"microsoft-的阶段模型"},{"level":3,"text":"环形发布与特性开关的结合","id":"环形发布与特性开关的结合"},{"level":3,"text":"环间推进的决策门","id":"环间推进的决策门"},{"level":2,"text":"蓝绿 + 金丝雀的混合策略","id":"蓝绿-金丝雀的混合策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Argo Rollouts 的蓝绿策略","id":"argo-rollouts-的蓝绿策略"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库兼容性策略","id":"数据库兼容性策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Expand-Contract 迁移模式","id":"expand-contract-迁移模式"},{"level":3,"text":"无中断 Schema 变更规则","id":"无中断-schema-变更规则"},{"level":2,"text":"流量路由技术","id":"流量路由技术"},{"level":3,"text":"DNS 切换","id":"dns-切换"},{"level":3,"text":"负载均衡器权重","id":"负载均衡器权重"},{"level":3,"text":"服务网格路由","id":"服务网格路由"},{"level":2,"text":"与 CI/CD 流水线的集成","id":"与-ci-cd-流水线的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"蓝绿 vs 金丝雀：选型决策","id":"蓝绿-vs-金丝雀-选型决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"金丝雀发布：流量切分、健康指标与自动回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/canary-releases"},"next":{"title":"百分比灰度策略：粘性哈希、渐进提升与紧急 Kill Switch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/percentage-rollout-strategies"}}